  "name": "Rapid Remedy",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/life/heart-cross-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, your treatment procedures are fast acting and effective. When you use a creation that restores hit points to a creature with a creation slot of 1st level or higher, you can choose to have the creation count as being cast with one creation slot higher. You can use this feature a number of times equal to 1 + your Wisdom modifier, regaining all uses at the end of a long rest.</p>\n<p>At 10th level, all of your creations that restore hit points can benefit from this feature, no longer requiring any uses.</p>",
